 pilots killed or missing-in-action, with another 177 evacuated with wounds or with sickness (especially severe malaria). The US Marine Corp aviation units did not have aerial superiority during this time and it was a hard lesson learned for times to come.","LocalizedString":"The US Marines air force units operating from Henderson Field on Guadalcanal island were referred to as the “Cactus Air Force”, “Cactus” being the Allied code name for the island. Japanese aerial losses during the campaign have never been calculated, but the 15 Marine combat squadrons that operated from the island during this time suffered from 94 pilots killed or missing-in-action, with another 177 evacuated with wounds or with sickness (especially severe malaria). The US Marine Corp aviation units did not have aerial superiority during this time and it was a hard lesson learned for times to come."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Rare","selectTargetOnPlayedFromHand":true,"cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Campaign2020","isReserved":true,"soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'TACTICAL_AIRSTRIKE_17'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Misc/OrdersFeb17/TACTICAL_AIRSTRIKE_17.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/USA/t_air_gunner.t_air_gunner","SubPathString":""},"Delay":1.2,"artist":"Alamy Stock Photo","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/DIRECT_HIT.DIRECT_HIT","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":411.0},"historyPhotoSource":"United States National Archives","historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_event_direct_hit_photo","SourceString":"TBF-1 Avenger “Daisy Mae” in flight, Henderson Field Guadalcanal, 1943.","LocalizedString":"TBF-1 Avenger “Daisy Mae” in flight, Henderson Field Guadalcanal, 1943."},"OnPlayedFromHandVisualsSoft":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Blueprints/Effects/BP_OrderDiveBomber.BP_OrderDiveBomber_C","SubPathString":""},"isRemoval":true},"variables":[],"functions":[{"name":"CanPlayFromHand","owner":"ca